# 02-ai-repository-cleanup .env Example

This file provides environment variables for the cleanup pipeline.
Copy this file to `.env` in your repository root and add your specific values.

## Required variables

BASE_DIR="/mnt/HDD1/repository-cleanup-dir"
GITHUB_ORG="Aldo-f"
GITLAB_GROUP="Aldo-f"
REPO_LIMIT=100

## Notes

- The script will load variables from `.env` in the same directory as the script first.
- If `.env` is not found, it will fall back to built-in defaults.
- To use AI feedback, ensure you have an AI CLI (hermes, opencode, or claude) installed and configured.
